      <profiles>
        <profile name="Experimental Battlesuit Refit" id="9978-9b65-1d30-6c58" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, at the start of each of your Command phases, select one Experimental Refit for that unit: 

Advanced Stabilization Jets: That unit&apos;s ranged weapons gain [ASSAULT] but cannot target units more than 18&quot; away. Each Experimental Refit lasts until the start of your next Command phase.

Overcharged Weapon Mounts: Each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If that attack targets a unit within 9&quot;, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that weapon by 1. 

Reactive Defense Matrix: Models in that unit have an Invulnerable Save 5+. If they already have an invulnerable save, improve it by 1 (to a maximum of 4+).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Shield Generator Overclock" id="17fb-a816-f3a1-0614" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, at the start of any phase, you can choose to give this model an Invulnerable Save 2+, which lasts until the end of the phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Commander Longknife" id="f0eb-850a-67af-55fe" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
