                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^T’au Empire Battlesuit^^** model only. Each time the bearer is select to shoot, select either the **[LETHAL HITS]** or **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability. Until those attacks are resolved, ranged weapons equipped by the bearer have the select ability.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
