                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Kroot Shaper^^** model only. In the Declare Battle Formations step, you can select up to three **^^Kroot Carnivores^^** or **^^Kroot Farstalkers^^** units from your army. Models in those units have the Deep Strike ability.</characteristic>
