                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^T&apos;au Empire^^** model (excluding **^^Kroot^^** models) only. In your Command phase, you can select one **^^Kroot^^** or **^^Vespid Stingwings^^** unit within 12&quot; of the bearer. If you do, until the start of your next Command phase, improve the Leadership characteristic of models in that unit by 1, and while such a unit is not Battle‑shocked, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
